on top of item 0 stock, which is close to the limit. If demand runs low, some delivery could be lost.\n\n**Daily plans.** A shortage costs much more than holding a spare unit (8 against 0.3 a day for item 0, 11 against 0.2 for item 1). So a scale slightly above 1.046 should pay off. But these plans never adjust to actual sales:\n- **Plan 6** (×1.25) builds up surplus, which spoils (9-day and 6-day shelf life) and is left over at the end.\n- **Plans 5 and 2** (×1.0 and ×0.9) will often run short.\n- **Plan 7** (×1.1) seems the best balance, with plan 4 just behind it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5048, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5048}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:13:06.783Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWC6GaztmZRTahJGJMf5"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01X5xHb6MRr9Vv9DYRRQsmS3", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWC6Gq8AhPtUBKsC4w74", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01X5xHb6MRr9Vv9DYRRQsmS3", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.75, 0.85, 0.8, 0.8, 0.4, 0.25, 0.3, 0.45]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5048, "cache_re